#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:1
#: 5541ea5e71d4423f8ce4b6809c3a8a41
msgid "Add a Robot"
msgstr "添加机器人"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:3
#: fe0961c8d04b4ddca48a67ee3fcac7ff
msgid ""
"This page is how a new robot enters the stack: the description package, "
"then ros2_control and OCS2, then Isaac Sim. Run a similar robot that is "
"already here before you start a chapter, and use that result as the "
"reference. Copy an existing description package and the launch and xacro "
"patterns already in the repo. Leave the verified shared parts for later "
"robots. The same work covers arms, mobile bases, dual-arm robots, and "
"humanoids."
msgstr ""
"这一页讲新机器人怎么进现有栈：先做描述包，再配 ros2_control 和 OCS2，最后进 Isaac "
"Sim。每一章动手之前，先把仓库里结构相近的机器人跑一遍，拿那个结果当参照。复制已有的描述包，以及仓库里现成的 launch 和 xacro "
"写法。已经核对过、可以共用的部分留给后面的机器人。机械臂、移动底盘、双臂和人形都走这一套。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:5
#: 0b16027ba0574082b1d97e3f40e070f1
msgid ""
"Chapter 1 finishes the description package: source material, meshes, "
"Xacro assembly, and the RViz preview. Chapter 2 configures ros2_control "
"and OCS2, and signs off in Mock. Chapter 3 imports the robot into Isaac "
"Sim and closes the loop between commands and feedback. At the end of each"
" chapter, record the evidence and the handoff for that stage. Splitting "
"meshes and assigning colors has to be done by hand in the Blender UI. The"
" other steps can use a skill for help, and you still check them on this "
"page. The skills are listed at the end of Chapter 3."
msgstr ""
"第 1 章完成描述包：上游资料、网格、Xacro 装配和 RViz 预览。第 2 章配置 ros2_control 和 OCS2，并在 Mock "
"下签收。第 3 章把机器人导入 Isaac Sim，把指令和反馈闭环跑通。每一章结束时，记下这一阶段的证据和交接。网格拆分和上色必须亲自在 "
"Blender 图形界面完成。其余环节可以用 skill 辅助，并在本页核对。可用的 skill 列在第 3 章末尾。"

