#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:15
#: ef9393cbacaa45afaf0989a746dea3b3
msgid ""
"Description-side Cursor skills: **`robot_descriptions` branch "
"`feature/agilex`** — [`.cursor/skills/README.md`](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions/blob/feature/agilex/.cursor/skills/README.md). "
"**`main` has no `.cursor/skills`**. `robot-descriptions-common` and "
"`robot_usds` have none on `main`. The agilex index lists **only** `split-"
"chassis-glb`."
msgstr ""
"描述侧 Cursor skill：在 **`robot_descriptions` 的 `feature/agilex` 分支** — "
"[`.cursor/skills/README.md`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions/blob/feature/agilex/.cursor/skills/README.md)。**`main`"
" 没有 `.cursor/skills`**。`robot-descriptions-common` 和 `robot_usds` 在 "
"`main` 上也没有。agilex 索引目前**只有** `split-chassis-glb`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:18
#: cd8667f7bf76473ba59565102383bd95
msgid "1. Description package: configuration, split, and modularization"
msgstr "​1. 描述包：配置、拆分与模块化"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:20
#: 6f255f556a204b07a8e74f2c09b74da7
msgid ""
"This chapter finishes the description package itself: upstream material "
"and reuse, mesh cleanup, Xacro assembly, and the static display and joint"
" preview in RViz."
msgstr "本章完成描述包本身：上游资料与复用、网格整理、Xacro 装配，以及 RViz 中的静态显示和关节预览。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:22
#: 457fe255613b42d696a4a5cb25df7331
msgid ""
"Before starting the description package for this robot, open a robot with"
" a similar structure and purpose in RViz. Look at the whole-robot display"
" and the joint preview, and use that as the reference."
msgstr "开始本机型的描述包工作前，先用结构和用途接近的现有机器人，在 RViz 中看过整机显示和关节预览，作为参照。"

