"`ocs2_wbc_controller` from the `ros-jazzy-arms-ros2-control` deb, or from"
" a source checkout. See [OCS2 WBC "
"Controller](../../4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md). It is **not** a"
" row in that branch’s README brand tables. There is no lean `open-deploy-"
"ws` Taku branch — [open-deploy-ws "
"Setup](../../1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md)."
msgstr ""
"**Taku**（Dyna / DVT1）也在 `feature/agilex` 的树里，路径是 "
"[`humanoid/Dyna/taku_description`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions/tree/feature/agilex/humanoid/Dyna/taku_description)。用"
" `robot_common_launch humanoid.launch.py robot:=taku` 可视化。控制用 "
"`split_body.launch.py` / `full_body.launch.py`，`robot:=taku`（[包 "
