"sim/robot_descriptions/blob/feature/agilex/humanoid/Dyna/taku_description/README.md)"
" §3.1 / §3.2），不是 `demo.launch.py`。公开 mock 是 "
"**`split_body.launch.py`**。**`full_body.launch.py`** 需要 `ros-jazzy-arms-"
"ros2-control` 这个 deb 里的 `ocs2_wbc_controller`，或一份源码检出。见 [OCS2 WBC "
"控制器](../../4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md)。它不在该分支 README "
"的品牌表里。没有精简的 `open-deploy-ws` Taku 分支，见 [open-deploy-ws "
"安装](../../1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:110
#: 24520131fdc14fffb40a01ef13517e00
msgid "1.4 Split and reassembly"
msgstr "1.4 拆分和复装"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:112
#: d11ac8e13d674fd8940aca3c11a95f5c
msgid ""
"The first time you bring in a description package and the meshes need "
"cleanup, you split the parts yourself in the Blender UI, and you select "
"and isolate objects or faces yourself. Export, then import again and "
"check. The other steps can use a skill for help, but you still open the "
"model and judge it, and you check it on this page. A model that already "
"works does not have to be split apart and rebuilt."
msgstr ""
"首次接入描述包、需要整理网格时，必须亲自在 Blender "
"图形界面完成零部件拆分，以及对象或面的选择与隔离检查，导出后再重新导入核对。其余环节可以使用 skill "
"辅助，但仍要自己打开模型判断，并在本页核对。不必把已经可用的现成模型全部拆开重做。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:114
#: d96ed9afbad84ddc9b51dbbf48c91ac7
msgid ""
"Import the vendor’s original STL, or the other source mesh, and keep a "
"copy to compare. When a broken triangle is already in the upstream mesh, "
"tell a normal-display problem apart from missing geometry."
msgstr "先导入厂家原始 STL 或其他网格，保留一份对照。三角破面在上游就存在时，区分法线显示问题与几何缺损。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:116
#: f481f9071a6d4bfb9a5f3dae96e0397f
msgid ""
"For every part, check it yourself in the Blender UI, in face select mode,"
" and separate loose parts. Use the Outliner or an isolated view, open the"
" model, and confirm the objects you split out are really there."
msgstr "每一个部件都要亲自在 Blender 图形界面，用面选择模式检查，按松散块分离。对照 Outliner 或隔离显示，打开模型确认拆出的对象真实存在。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:118
#: 9553a18c797d4ab1b50316e4ba2ad229
msgid ""
"This is a part after it has been split into loose pieces in Blender. "
"Several named objects are selected together, and each one can be checked "
"in the Outliner."
msgstr "下面是在 Blender 中把一个部件按松散块拆开后的样子：多个具名对象同时选中，可在 Outliner 中逐项核对。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:120
#: bbf925087b0e4d1eb74984405074a505
msgid "![A part split into loose pieces in Blender](images/blender-parts.png)"
msgstr "![在 Blender 中按松散块拆分零部件](images/blender-parts.png)"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:120
#: a438faa2e31a466fad0a75f8f5553eb9
msgid "A part split into loose pieces in Blender"
msgstr "在 Blender 中按松散块拆分零部件"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:122
#: 5ac0da8f7a054647a885228bb64bca15
msgid ""
"Keep shells, panels, light strips, wheel modules, leveling feet, and "
"anything else that has a role in the assembly. Merge small bolts, nuts, "
"and washers that have no role of their own into the component they belong"
" to, so you do not keep a pile of meaningless fragments."
msgstr "按装配含义保留外壳、面板、灯条、轮组、调平脚等。把缺少独立用途的小螺栓、螺母和垫片合进对应组件，避免大量无意义碎块。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:124
#: 509cbb511ad843b4b205ca4b7f2bc675
msgid ""
"Name mesh objects by what the part is for, including the lower-level "
"pieces split out of it, and tidy the numbering."
msgstr "尽量按部件（以及拆分出来的下级组件）用途命名网格对象，整理编号。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:126
#: e103ec589af14eb2a7ca250e4f89dde6
msgid ""
"Export one GLB for each reusable part. One GLB can hold several named "
"objects. In the export dialog, set Format to glTF Binary (glb), and turn "
"on Limit to Selected Objects, so the file contains only the objects that "
"are selected now. Import it back into Blender and confirm the objects "
"were not fused into one."
msgstr ""
"每个可复用部件导出一个 GLB，GLB 内可以同时保留多个具名对象。导出时在对话框中把 `Format` 设为 `glTF Binary "
"(glb)`，并勾选 `Limit to Selected Objects`，只把当前选中的对象写入该文件。导出后在 Blender "
"中重新导入，确认对象没有被合成一个。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:128
#: 399f843cc0824e91beb6f9ceb1a52d7f
msgid "This is the export dialog with Limit to Selected Objects turned on."
msgstr "下面是导出 GLB 时勾选 `Limit to Selected Objects` 的对话框示例。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:130
#: 22bca713628c4c9484f2b168abaffc1a
msgid ""
"![Export GLB with Limit to Selected Objects turned on](images/blender-"
"selected-export.png)"
msgstr "![导出 GLB 时只写入当前选中的对象](images/blender-selected-export.png)"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:130
#: ee36620d4f344a61ac3041907f3655bd
msgid "Export GLB with Limit to Selected Objects turned on"
msgstr "导出 GLB 时只写入当前选中的对象"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:132
#: 783ae8d1c72b4a14b183df57a0a33ebe
msgid ""
"For repeated parts on the same robot, compare geometry, material, and "
"coordinates first. Left and right arms, grippers, wheels, legs, and "
"leveling feet can be reused with a rigid transform, or with a mirror you "
"have checked. When the triangulation differs, judge by the surface "
"deviation after the parts are registered."
msgstr "同机重复件先比较几何、材质和坐标。左右臂、夹爪、车轮、腿部和调平脚等，可通过刚体变换或经验证的镜像复用。三角剖分不同可用配准后的表面偏差判断。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:134
#: 58c567ee17ab4cb0b7f092d6509dc6e5
msgid ""
"A repeated kinematic chain can share one component macro. Use `prefix` to"
" tell the instances apart, and to tell their link and joint names apart. "
"Mirror the mesh with the `direction` parameter. Mount pose, the real "
"inertia on each side, and the limits are still given per side. After "
"expansion, check joint direction, end position, inertia, and joint axis "
"on each side."
msgstr ""
"重复运动链可共用一套组件宏，用 `prefix` 区分各侧实例以及连杆、关节命名。网格镜像用 `direction` "
"参数处理；安装位姿、两侧实际惯量与限位仍要按侧给出。展开后逐侧核对关节方向、末端位置、惯量和关节轴。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:136
#: 18817f5f0c104b71b79e769dd5de958e
msgid ""
"Compare wheel modules, mounts, adapter plates, leveling feet, and knobs. "
"When the fixed relationship is the same, take out one subassembly and "
"mount it again in Xacro at the real pose of each mount point. One GLB "
"that holds several named objects can be referenced the same way."
msgstr ""
"比对轮组、安装座、转接板、调平脚与旋钮。若固定关系一致，提取一份子总成，在 Xacro 中按各安装点的实际位姿复装。同一份含多个具名对象的 GLB"
" 也可以这样引用。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:138
#: 33a1bbcc022b44cebed94c12c0387b64
msgid ""
"Use one convention for mesh coordinates, units, origin, and axes. Check "
"XYZ on the mesh after the transform, so a GLB axis conversion or a node "
"transform does not leave a part looking as if it turned 90°."
msgstr "统一网格坐标、单位、原点和轴向。用变换后的网格核对 XYZ，避免 GLB 的轴转换或节点变换让部件看起来旋转了 90°。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:140
#: f7afbcdd469d4af794328e7aabcabc24
msgid ""
"When the source asset is OBJ, confirm the matching MTL and the textures "
"came with the source files. On export, keep the materials and the "
"original split normals. For a description mesh that is already aligned to"
" ROS Z-up, use `export_yup=False`. In this workflow that value is "
"required for RViz to show the mesh in the correct orientation. After "
"export, check the orientation, the size, and the sharp edges of the whole"
" part in RViz. Remove old formats from the repository only after the new "
"asset is usable."
msgstr ""
"如果源资产是 OBJ，确认配套 MTL 和纹理随源文件齐全。导出时保留材质和原始分裂法线。对于已按 ROS Z-up 对齐的描述网格，使用 "
"`export_yup=False`：这是本流程中让 RViz 正确显示网格方向的必要配置。导出后再在 RViz "
"核对整件朝向、尺寸和锐边。确认新资产可用后再清理仓库中的旧格式。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:142
#: 1066fd2b9ca34201a3c075e890c2692c
msgid ""
"When there is a steered wheel module, assign the components by the three "
"relationships: fixed, following the steer, and rolling with the wheel. "
"Put the local origin on the steer axis and on the wheel axis separately. "
"In RViz, jog the steer once and the roll once, and check the axis, the "
"parts that follow, and any mesh that shows up twice."
msgstr ""
"有转向轮组时，按固定、随转向、随车轮滚动三种关系分配组件。以转向轴和车轮轴心分别设置局部原点。在 RViz "
"各试动一次转向和滚动，核对转轴、随动部件及重复显示。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:144
#: 502fa86897eb4b1584a952a7181a38bd
msgid ""
"On **`feature/agilex` only**, the skills index currently lists one skill:"
" **`split-chassis-glb`** ([SKILL.md](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions/blob/feature/agilex/.cursor/skills/split-chassis-"
"glb/SKILL.md)). Canonical example in that skill: "
"`rokae_inex_description`. That is the public branch index. The company "
"description repository lists further skills at the end of Chapter 3."
msgstr ""
"**仅在 `feature/agilex` 上**，skills 索引目前只列了一个 skill： **`split-chassis-"
"glb`**（[SKILL.md](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions/blob/feature/agilex/.cursor/skills/split-chassis-"
"glb/SKILL.md)）。该 skill 的规范示例是 `rokae_inex_description`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:146
#: 2663ddd606924bca89cec7398db65f1d
msgid "What it does (overview; follow the skill for the full procedure):"
msgstr "它做什么（概览；完整步骤以 skill 为准）："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:148
#: b641f3bb97a64495992cd530e1e9864d
msgid ""
"Split one assembled chassis GLB into `chassis` / `steer` / `wheel` meshes"
" with joint-ready origins"
msgstr "把一个装配好的底盘 GLB 拆成 `chassis` / `steer` / `wheel` 网格，原点已对齐关节"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:149
#: e0e7485929174bfbb30cffa62919adc5
msgid ""
"Write swerve xacro (reuse one steer + one wheel at `fl` `fr` `rl` `rr`; "
"right modules yaw 180°, no mesh reflect)"
msgstr "写舵轮 xacro（在 `fl` `fr` `rl` `rr` 复用同一套 steer + wheel；右侧模块 yaw 180°，不镜像网格）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:150
#: 9e4b1142f435494bb5874f25670dd134
msgid ""
"Add `collider:=simple` boxes from **glTF-node** AABBs (not raw accessor "
"min/max)"
msgstr "用 **glTF 节点** AABB 加 `collider:=simple` 盒子（不是 accessor 的原始 min/max）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:152
#: c369f0f9ffb4416e8ef7d11738895986
msgid ""
"How to add more skills under `.cursor/skills/`: the same [skills "
"README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions/blob/feature/agilex/.cursor/skills/README.md) "
"(folder [`.cursor/skills/`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions/tree/feature/agilex/.cursor/skills)). The index "
"currently lists **only** `split-chassis-glb`."
msgstr ""
"如何在 `.cursor/skills/` 下加更多 skill：同一份 [skills README](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions/blob/feature/agilex/.cursor/skills/README.md)（目录 "
"[`.cursor/skills/`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions/tree/feature/agilex/.cursor/skills)）。索引目前**只有** "
"`split-chassis-glb`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:155
#: c1300ad8983541c6bee69ea677651a88
msgid ""
"Compare the whole-robot assembly before and after the split. Check the "
"position, the orientation, the seams, the motion clearance, and the "
"ground height of each instance."
msgstr "对比拆分前后的整机装配，核对各实例的位置、朝向、接缝、运动间隙和落地高度。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:157
#: f1ad649838d84af0b71c1e9bc8aa8cc6
msgid ""
"After the split, check model paths and what each file is for. Keep the "
"mount pose of a whole part in the component Xacro. If a leftover complete"
" mesh is still used for collision, record that reference."
msgstr "拆分后检查模型路径和文件职责。整件安装姿态在组件 Xacro 中集中管理，残留完整网格若仍用于碰撞，明确记录引用。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:159
#: e78fc471e3434002a3d9bb4eb440cf0a
msgid ""
"The meshes a description package exports at the end are GLB. Import them "
"again after export, and check orientation, size, material, and structure "
"in RViz. DAE, STL, and OBJ stay as the upstream source, or as "
"intermediate files while you convert."
msgstr ""
"描述包最终导出的网格统一使用 GLB。导出后重新导入，并在 RViz 中核对方向、尺寸、材质和结构。DAE、STL、OBJ "
"等只作为上游源或转换过程中的中间材料。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:161
#: 06f9fd0454c5487797a1ecaaca895984
msgid "1.5 Appearance"
msgstr "1.5 外观"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:163
#: 439c5b7b43964026b582d2c3159dc5f2
msgid ""
"The first coloring and the first material assignment are done in the "
"Blender UI. Then compare with the product photos, and look at the "
"materials and the colors yourself."
msgstr "首次上色和材质分配在 Blender 图形界面完成，再对照产品图，自己查看材质和颜色。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:165
#: 3fd4eeea24024f7a91c56a5cd799335a
msgid ""
"Using product photos from different angles, check the colors of the "
"front, the sides, the arms, the face, and small parts that stick out. "
"Record color, metallic, roughness, and emission."
msgstr "对照厂家不同角度的产品图，核对正面、侧面、手臂、脸部和突出小件的颜色。记录颜色、金属度、粗糙度和自发光。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:167
#: 4d94e4d784524d1a9b4383aba5106afa
msgid ""
"Use one set of English material names. Similar dark gray, light gray, and"
" matte black can be merged. In Blender, assign materials and colors on "
"the real components, and look for stray triangles whose color stands out."
" After a mesh update, import the GLB back into Blender and check the "
"named child objects, the material assignment, and the assembled result. "
"If only the material changed, compare the geometry and the transforms "
"before and after."
msgstr ""
"英文材质名统一，同类深灰、浅灰和哑黑可归并。在 Blender 中按实际组件分配材质并上色，检查有没有颜色突兀的零散三角面。网格更新后在 "
"Blender 中重新导入 GLB，检查具名子对象、材质分配和装配效果。若只调整材质，再对比更新前后的几何和变换。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:169
#: 9e18859d8d8847458540580f18371679
msgid ""
"For covers, trim, and other parts that cross a seam, check the surface "
"and the edges. Look for gaps, protrusions, and interpenetration on the "
"single part, at the assembled zero pose, and through the motion range of "
"the nearby joints."
msgstr "对挡板、饰盖和其他跨接缝部件检查曲面及边缘。分别在单件、装配零位和邻近关节运动范围内查看空缺、凸起与穿模。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:171
#: 71cd45b919a54c0cb5dc85f7640a713d
msgid "1.6 Xacro assembly"
msgstr "1.6 Xacro 装配"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:173
#: dadd0c48332c41cbbfaa48f2d193798e
msgid ""
"The usual conventions: angles in Xacro are written with a `PI` property. "
"When you split left and right parts, both sides share one component "
"macro. Use `prefix` to tell the instances apart, and to tell their link "
"and joint names apart. Mirror the mesh with the `direction` parameter. "
"The values and the transform follow a similar description package and the"
" real geometry of the part. Check inertia and the joint axis on each "
"side."
msgstr ""
"常见约定：Xacro 中的角度用 `PI` 属性表达。拆分左右部件时，左右共用一套组件宏，用 `prefix` "
"区分各侧实例以及连杆、关节命名；网格的镜像用 `direction` "
"参数处理。具体取值和变换写法跟同类描述包和该部件的实际几何。两侧惯量和关节轴要逐侧核对。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:175
#: a0a356ee03c24ccab83dbeadddf6b386
msgid ""
"Define `PI` with `xacro:property`. The limits below turn degrees into "
"radians. The numbers are only a W2 example. Another robot uses its own "
"limits."
msgstr "`PI` 用 `xacro:property` 定义。下面这些限位把角度换成弧度，其中的数值只是 W2 的示例，其他机器人应使用自己的限位。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:177
#: c2de48fc1b25454282a3885da0bf74fb
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"<robot name=\"FiveAges W2\" "
"xmlns:xacro=\"http://www.ros.org/wiki/xacro\">\n"
"  <xacro:property name=\"PI\" value=\"3.1415926535897931\"/>\n"
"  <xacro:property name=\"body_joint1_lower\" value=\"-${PI*77.5/180}\"/>\n"
"  <xacro:property name=\"body_joint1_upper\" value=\"${PI*32.5/180}\"/>\n"
"  <xacro:property name=\"body_joint2_lower\" "
"value=\"-${PI*152.41/180}\"/>\n"
"  <xacro:property name=\"body_joint2_upper\" value=\"${PI*91.96/180}\"/>\n"
"  <xacro:property name=\"body_joint3_lower\" value=\"-${PI*100/180}\"/>\n"
"  <xacro:property name=\"body_joint3_upper\" value=\"${PI*100/180}\"/>\n"
"  <xacro:property name=\"body_joint4_lower\" value=\"-${PI}\"/>\n"
"  <xacro:property name=\"body_joint4_upper\" value=\"${PI}\"/>\n"
"</robot>"
msgstr ""
"<robot name=\"FiveAges W2\" "
"xmlns:xacro=\"http://www.ros.org/wiki/xacro\">\n"
"  <xacro:property name=\"PI\" value=\"3.1415926535897931\"/>\n"
"  <xacro:property name=\"body_joint1_lower\" value=\"-${PI*77.5/180}\"/>\n"
"  <xacro:property name=\"body_joint1_upper\" value=\"${PI*32.5/180}\"/>\n"
"  <xacro:property name=\"body_joint2_lower\" "
"value=\"-${PI*152.41/180}\"/>\n"
"  <xacro:property name=\"body_joint2_upper\" value=\"${PI*91.96/180}\"/>\n"
"  <xacro:property name=\"body_joint3_lower\" value=\"-${PI*100/180}\"/>\n"
"  <xacro:property name=\"body_joint3_upper\" value=\"${PI*100/180}\"/>\n"
"  <xacro:property name=\"body_joint4_lower\" value=\"-${PI}\"/>\n"
"  <xacro:property name=\"body_joint4_upper\" value=\"${PI}\"/>\n"
"</robot>"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:191
#: 4f6c409d5853447cb6f3d51704b6e459
msgid ""
"Find a few similar description packages first. Compare the package "
"layout, the component entry, and how mesh paths are written. Then check "
"your own `CMakeLists.txt`, `package.xml`, README, and runtime "
"dependencies. Hardware backends and controller configuration are done in "
"Chapter 2."
msgstr ""
"先找几个同类描述包，对照包目录、组件入口和网格路径写法。再核对自己的 `CMakeLists.txt`、`package.xml`、README "
"和运行时依赖。硬件后端和控制器配置在第 2 章完成。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:193
#: 1a3e6664ee72410b8a5054d618aea204
msgid ""
"Define the modules from the assembly drawing. The whole-robot Xacro "
"instantiates them and passes the mount parameters. Left-right parts share"
" one component macro. Use `prefix` for the instance and for the link and "
"joint names, and use the `direction` parameter to mirror the mesh. Write "
"angles with the `PI` property. Check the component and the whole-robot "
"entry separately, and check the assembly, the joint direction, the end "
"position, the inertia, and the joint axis on each side."
msgstr ""
"按装配图定义模块，整机 Xacro 负责实例化并传入安装参数。左右对称件共用一套组件宏，用 `prefix` 区分实例及连杆、关节命名，网格镜像用"
" `direction` 参数处理。角度用 `PI` 属性表达。分别验证组件和整机入口，并逐侧核对装配、关节方向、末端位置、惯量和关节轴。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:195
#: 5ef659e9120d4dd99dbd10fc62e3fac8
msgid ""
"The excerpt below is one link inside the macro, not a whole robot. "
"`prefix` is built from `name`. In this part, `direction` is applied to "
"the mesh scale on Y, the center of mass on Y, the inertia products `ixy` "
"and `iyz`, and the collision position on Y. Check the visual, the center "
"of mass, the inertia, and the collision against the real geometry."
msgstr ""
"下面是宏里单个 link 的节选，不是完整机器人。`prefix` 由 `name` 生成。在这个部件里，`direction` 同时作用在网格的"
" Y 缩放、质心的 Y、惯量 `ixy` / `iyz`，以及碰撞体的 Y 位置上。外观、质心、惯量和碰撞都要按实际几何核对。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:197
#: c1287262c2c2416387e72b9a005bfac3
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"<xacro:macro name=\"Tron2BDachArm\" params=\"name parent direction:=1\">\n"
"    <xacro:property name=\"prefix\" value=\"${name + '_' if name else "
"''}\" />\n"
"    <link name=\"${prefix}proximal_pitch_Link\">\n"
"      <inertial>\n"
"        <origin xyz=\"0.0033 ${0.06714 * direction} -0.00603\" />\n"
"        <mass value=\"2.05\" />\n"
"        <inertia ixx=\"0.00389778\" ixy=\"${-0.00013725 * direction}\" "
"ixz=\"4.62e-05\"\n"
"                 iyy=\"0.00320014\" iyz=\"${5.272e-05 * direction}\" "
"izz=\"0.00357523\" />\n"
"      </inertial>\n"
"      <visual>\n"
"        <geometry>\n"
"          <mesh filename=\"file://$(find "
"tron2b_dach_description)/meshes/arm/proximal_pitch.glb\" scale=\"1 "
"${direction} 1\" />\n"
"        </geometry>\n"
"      </visual>\n"
"      <collision>\n"
"        <origin xyz=\"0.0006538 ${0.0608031 * direction} -0.0061907\" "
"rpy=\"1.57079632679 0 0\" />\n"
"        <geometry>\n"
"          <cylinder radius=\"0.0678046\" length=\"0.1355752\" />\n"
"        </geometry>\n"
"      </collision>\n"
"    </link>\n"
"</xacro:macro>"
msgstr ""
"<xacro:macro name=\"Tron2BDachArm\" params=\"name parent direction:=1\">\n"
"    <xacro:property name=\"prefix\" value=\"${name + '_' if name else "
"''}\" />\n"
"    <link name=\"${prefix}proximal_pitch_Link\">\n"
"      <inertial>\n"
"        <origin xyz=\"0.0033 ${0.06714 * direction} -0.00603\" />\n"
"        <mass value=\"2.05\" />\n"
"        <inertia ixx=\"0.00389778\" ixy=\"${-0.00013725 * direction}\" "
"ixz=\"4.62e-05\"\n"
"                 iyy=\"0.00320014\" iyz=\"${5.272e-05 * direction}\" "
"izz=\"0.00357523\" />\n"
"      </inertial>\n"
"      <visual>\n"
"        <geometry>\n"
"          <mesh filename=\"file://$(find "
"tron2b_dach_description)/meshes/arm/proximal_pitch.glb\" scale=\"1 "
"${direction} 1\" />\n"
"        </geometry>\n"
"      </visual>\n"
"      <collision>\n"
"        <origin xyz=\"0.0006538 ${0.0608031 * direction} -0.0061907\" "
"rpy=\"1.57079632679 0 0\" />\n"
"        <geometry>\n"
"          <cylinder radius=\"0.0678046\" length=\"0.1355752\" />\n"
"        </geometry>\n"
"      </collision>\n"
"    </link>\n"
"</xacro:macro>"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:222
#: ffb0f1b6257341f390a54c459505e571
msgid ""
"A mesh reference uses `file://$(find <package>)/<path-inside-the-"
"package>`, so later visualization tools can find the mesh. Check zero "
"offsets, zero rotations, and redundant attributes, and keep the fields "
"that express a transform you need."
msgstr ""
"引用 mesh 必须使用 `file://$(find "
"包名)/包内相对路径`，这样后续其他可视化工具才能找到网格。检查零偏移、零旋转和冗余属性，保留表达必要变换的字段。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:224
#: 9d2f1d3e1e08404cb5f6540244182263
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"<geometry>\n"
"  <mesh filename=\"file://$(find "
"tron2b_dach_description)/meshes/arm/proximal_pitch.glb\" scale=\"1 "
"${direction} 1\" />\n"
"</geometry>"
msgstr ""
"<geometry>\n"
"  <mesh filename=\"file://$(find "
"tron2b_dach_description)/meshes/arm/proximal_pitch.glb\" scale=\"1 "
"${direction} 1\" />\n"
"</geometry>"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:230
#: a88bc421d9bc40a19b018c73e8a9fe6d
msgid ""
"The fragment below is the visual inside a sensor link. When `isaac` is "
"true, the `visual` is omitted and the link frame stays. When `isaac` is "
"false, ordinary visualization still has the visual."
msgstr "下面是传感器 link 内部的外观片段：`isaac` 为真时省略 `visual`，连杆坐标保留；为假时普通可视化仍保留外观。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:232
#: 15486bdf8f824b3797dbf213beed390e
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"<xacro:unless value=\"${isaac}\">\n"
"  <visual>\n"
"    <geometry>\n"
"      <mesh filename=\"file://$(find "
"sensor_models)/meshes/realsense/d455.glb\" />\n"
"    </geometry>\n"
"  </visual>\n"
"</xacro:unless>"
msgstr ""
"<xacro:unless value=\"${isaac}\">\n"
"  <visual>\n"
"    <geometry>\n"
"      <mesh filename=\"file://$(find "
"sensor_models)/meshes/realsense/d455.glb\" />\n"
"    </geometry>\n"
"  </visual>\n"
"</xacro:unless>"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:242
#: 11951abcf2694a72ae0273db93cdc35e
msgid ""
"Planning and ordinary visualization usually keep the wheel modules fixed."
" Wheel motion is enabled when the robot is imported into Isaac. "
"`wheel_joint_type` sets the joint type. `joints_movable` controls whether"
" `axis` is written. Set the two together."
msgstr ""
"规划和普通可视化通常固定轮组，导入 Isaac 时启用轮组运动。`wheel_joint_type` "
"设置关节类型，`joints_movable` 控制 `axis` 是否输出，两者配套设置。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:244
#: b19e769bad7d4d3b8d5c28a50b88be8c
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"<joint name=\"fr_wheel_joint\" type=\"${wheel_joint_type}\">\n"
"  <origin xyz=\"-0.00071653 -0.003566 -0.136\"/>\n"
"  <parent link=\"fr_steer\"/>\n"
"  <child link=\"fr_wheel\"/>\n"
"  <xacro:if value=\"${joints_movable}\">\n"
"    <axis xyz=\"0 1 0\"/>\n"
"  </xacro:if>\n"
"</joint>"
msgstr ""
"<joint name=\"fr_wheel_joint\" type=\"${wheel_joint_type}\">\n"
"  <origin xyz=\"-0.00071653 -0.003566 -0.136\"/>\n"
"  <parent link=\"fr_steer\"/>\n"
"  <child link=\"fr_wheel\"/>\n"
"  <xacro:if value=\"${joints_movable}\">\n"
"    <axis xyz=\"0 1 0\"/>\n"
"  </xacro:if>\n"
"</joint>"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:255
#: 61d966c713694a07970781e785d067bc
msgid ""
"When there is an upstream URDF, expand the whole-robot Xacro with the "
"equivalent options and compare it with the upstream file: joint type, "
"parent and child links, mount pose, axis, limits, mass, inertia, and mesh"
" references. Record each intentional change and why it was made."
msgstr "有上游 URDF 时，用等效选项展开整机 Xacro，与上游对比关节类型、父子连杆、安装位姿、转轴、限位、质量、惯量和网格引用。记录有意改动及原因。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:257
#: c61f8c9930044b0c98d1671a9b745032
msgid ""
"Confirm the end-effector frame (TCP) sits at the useful position on the "
"gripper. In RViz, check that frame against the gripper geometry. The "
"interactive target and the target marker are checked in Chapter 2."
msgstr "确认末端参考系（TCP）在夹爪有效位置。在 RViz 中核对该坐标系与夹爪几何的相对位置。交互目标与目标框的检查在第 2 章进行。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:259
#: 9298ea77a84644bb86576a12f4ea3bfe
msgid ""
"EEF / FT / TCP launch arguments are `type` / `left_type` / `right_type` "
"(not `gripper:=`)."
msgstr "末端 / 力传感器 / TCP：`type` / `left_type` / `right_type`（不是 `gripper:=`）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:262
#: 7b92b12ac2e7487bb68592ddd0e0c3fe
msgid ""
"Check the left and right grippers separately: the driving joint, the "
"follower joint, the open and close direction, and the normalized "
"position. Compare the driven angle with the real opening."
msgstr "分别检查左、右夹爪的主动关节、随动关节、开合方向和归一化位置。对照驱动角度与实际开口。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:264
#: 9241e144f9414749929d7a64964d5950
msgid ""
"When a motion direction needs a smaller range, first confirm the positive"
" and negative joint directions and the lower and upper limits in the "
"description package. The same limit can be applied in more than one "
"layer. Check it against the real limits of this robot. The limits used by"
" planning, control, and simulation are checked in Chapter 2 and Chapter "
"3."
msgstr ""
"如需缩小某个运动方向的范围，先在描述包中确认关节正负方向和上下限。相同的限位需求可能做在不同层，按本机型的实际限位核对。规划、控制和仿真各自使用的限位，分别在第"
" 2 章和第 3 章核对。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:266
#: d7c5d68c8883491bbc2149047abcb6db
msgid "1.7 Static display and joint preview in RViz"
msgstr "1.7 RViz 静态与关节预览"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:268
#: 46482624da5d48f6afd3a68652de4d59
msgid "Register the description in the deploy workspace, then open RViz."
msgstr "先在部署工作空间里注册描述包，再打开 RViz。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:270
#: 176927cdc58d46ffa8f0618f38de1ec9
msgid "In `open-deploy-ws`:"
msgstr "在 `open-deploy-ws` 中："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:272
#: 0c95b1c5ca8b4540af261baf90b0ac25
msgid "`./init_repo.sh` so nested modules match `submodules_visibility.conf`."
msgstr "`./init_repo.sh`，让嵌套模块与 `submodules_visibility.conf` 一致。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:273
#: d9edb44c603b42909d2f9975ab9588ce
msgid ""
"If you added a **new** nested submodule: add the Git submodule on the "
"parent, then one pipe line `parent_dir|relative_path|public` or `private`"
" — [Submodules Visibility](../../3-concepts/6-submodules_visibility.md)."
msgstr ""
"若新增**嵌套**子模块：先在父仓加 Git submodule，再在 conf 加一行 "
"`parent_dir|relative_path|public` 或 `private` — "
"[子模块可见性](../../3-concepts/6-submodules_visibility.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:274
#: 5e8a13a5fc1c4a7fb14458ced7cef186
msgid ""
"`colcon build --symlink-install`. Lean branches (`arx-lift2s`, `panthera-"
"ht`): prefer **`./quick_start.sh`** (it sources `install/setup.bash` "
"after a successful build). On `main`, after colcon, `source "
"install/setup.bash` in the launch terminal (standard ROS overlay; no "
"extra env script)."
msgstr ""
"`colcon build --symlink-install`。精简分支（`arx-lift2s`、`panthera-ht`）：优先 "
"**`./quick_start.sh`**（构建成功后它会 source `install/setup.bash`）。在 `main` "
"上，colcon 之后在启动终端 `source install/setup.bash`（标准 ROS overlay；没有额外环境脚本）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:276
#: 266cd6c368164b1e8ca291be58245119
msgid ""
"[robot-descriptions-arx README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-"
"descriptions-arx/blob/main/README.md) also shows adding the brand repo as"
" `src/robot-descriptions-arx` or `git submodule update --init "
"manipulator/ARX` under the umbrella. Prefer the deploy-ws init script "
"when you are in `open-deploy-ws`."
msgstr ""
"[robot-descriptions-arx README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-"
"descriptions-arx/blob/main/README.md) 也写了把品牌仓加为 `src/robot-descriptions-"
"arx`，或在伞形仓下 `git submodule update --init manipulator/ARX`。在 `open-deploy-"
"ws` 里优先用部署工作区的 init 脚本。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:278
#: 3be237a47080405faf1a40ade80ae2ff
msgid ""
"Preview the model with the common launch, for example after the workspace"
" overlay:"
msgstr "工作空间环境叠加上去之后，用公共 launch 预览模型，例如："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:280
#: eede54d29f1c4b738f705aba796f781f
msgid "ros2 launch robot_common_launch manipulator.launch.py robot:=arx_acone"
msgstr "ros2 launch robot_common_launch manipulator.launch.py robot:=arx_acone"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:284
#: 283209599cec4ad3a1101477b5c9365d
msgid ""
"Controller launches are in Chapter 2. Launch files and hardware-interface"
" class names come from the package you copied and its vendor HI README."
msgstr "launch 文件和驱动层类名来自你复制的那个包及其厂商 HI README。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:286
#: a076bad43ada4c138098ed5f17f54ae8
msgid ""
"Open the whole robot in RViz first. Confirm `Fixed Frame`, the RobotModel"
" status, `robot_description`, `joint_states`, and TF. When a moving part "
"such as an arm is missing, tell a missing TF apart from a mesh that "
"failed to load."
msgstr ""
"先用 RViz 查看整机，确认 `Fixed Frame`、RobotModel "
"状态、`robot_description`、`joint_states` 和 TF。缺少手臂等可动部分时，区分 TF 缺失和网格读取失败。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:288
#: 087eaff9c16b4f6381cf20b311d27a8d
msgid "1.8 Sign-off and handoff"
msgstr "1.8 验收与交接"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:290
#: 6d6896c7f6f948f793e1b226c46e250c
msgid ""
"When meshes are cleaned up for the first time, the sign-off should be "
"able to say that the split check and the color setup were done in the "
"Blender UI, and that the export was checked by importing it again."
msgstr "首次整理网格时，验收应能说明已在 Blender 图形界面完成拆分检查和上色配置，并用重新导入的结果核对导出是否正确。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:292
#: d5b0d31b492a4b9c831a99d5e49f9e2a
msgid ""
"From the installed package, expand the default whole robot, the variants "
"you deliver, and each component entry. Use `check_urdf` to confirm the "
"URDF parses and the joint tree is valid. Also check that each mesh path "
"in the expanded result resolves to a file."
msgstr ""
"从安装后的包分别展开默认整机、交付的变体和各组件入口。用 `check_urdf` 验证 URDF "
"能解析且关节树有效，另逐一核对展开结果中的网格路径能否解析到文件。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:294
#: 8681130f1a9a44879e5f0a8f7f6260c4
msgid ""
"Write the README the way similar robots do. Cover the build, the "
"visualization, the component preview entry, and the parts, sensors, and "
"upstream variants that were actually reused. Use a generic example "
"workspace, paths relative to the repository, and the shortest commands, "
"and check that the links and the commands match the current code."
msgstr ""
"README "
"参考同类机器人，写清构建、可视化、组件预览入口，以及实际复用的部件、传感器和上游变体。用通用示例工作空间、仓库相对路径和最简命令，并核对其中的链接和命令与当前代码一致。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:296
#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:378
#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:472
#: 5061bdd3bd88431a8c6ee02c59fd0662 648e0fd021964536b8f2bcbac13e50eb
#: a74d1cfdec794cca8292abc5b8f9e6e2
msgid ""
"The handoff note names the repositories, branches, commits, and evidence "
"that were actually pushed at this stage. List, on their own, the items "
"that were not pushed, still need a real measurement, or still need to be "
"merged."
msgstr "交接记录写清本阶段实际推送的仓库、分支、commit 和验证证据。未推送、待实测或待合入的项目单列。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:298
#: 339226b3380043be801ad0e182d094dc
msgid ""
"After the description package is signed off, pose the whole robot in "
"viser, frame the view, and take the screenshot for the robot portrait. "
"Doubao can remove the background, and GIMP can clean a watermark. On the "
"finished image, check that the robot outline, the small parts, and the "
"material colors stay clear and are not distorted. Keep the original "
"screenshot to compare against, and deliver it with the rest of this "
"stage."
msgstr ""
"描述包验收完成后，在 viser 中摆好整机姿态与视角，截图制作机器人定妆照。可用豆包去除背景，再用 GIMP "
"清理水印。成图要核对机器人轮廓、细小部件和材质颜色保持清楚、不失真。建议保留原始截图供对照，并随本阶段成果一起交付。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:300
#: 385f0e9839994ca096a29c780d26ba00
msgid "2. Configure ros2_control and OCS2"
msgstr "​2. 配置 ros2_control 与 OCS2"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:302
#: a26003504dee4bae89f646c78f9a6ef1
msgid ""
"This chapter configures the control interfaces, keeps the runtime model "
"and the planning model apart, checks `task.info` against the startup log,"
" and signs off under Mock. When you use OCS2 whole-body control, `ocs2"
"-wbc-controller` can be installed from a deb. You do not need access to "
"the private source repository."
msgstr ""
"本章配置控制接口，区分运行模型和规划模型，按启动日志核对 `task.info`，并在 Mock 下验收。使用 OCS2 全身控制时，`ocs2"
"-wbc-controller` 可用 deb 安装，不必申请私有源码仓库权限。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:304
#: e40b9ec59119473da0cad73ad7355ca6
msgid ""
"Before configuring control for this robot, run Mock control on a similar "
"existing robot. Look at a normal state change and at command feedback, "
"and use that as the reference."
msgstr "开始本机型的控制配置前，先用同类现有机器人跑通 Mock 控制，看过正常的状态切换和指令反馈，作为参照。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:306
#: 49161665c99145869286ce8576c1a0c1
msgid "2.1 Control interfaces and models"
msgstr "2.1 控制接口与模型"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:308
#: 95182605ca3c43149888de7588f20495
msgid ""
"`interfaces` is where the modular control interfaces are imported. "
"`robot.xacro` in the `ros2_control` directory is where the import of the "
"whole hardware system is organized."
msgstr ""
"`interfaces` 用于导入模块化的控制接口；`ros2_control` 文件夹里面的 `robot.xacro` 用来组织整个 "
"`hardware system` 的导入。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:310
#: e5360ac927de4bcd93e340f01ffddcda
msgid ""
"Compare the hardware backends and the controller groups that similar "
"description packages support, and finish the ros2_control interfaces and "
"the controller configuration for this robot. Import the modular control "
"interfaces in `interfaces`. Organize the import of the whole hardware "
"system in `ros2_control/robot.xacro`."
msgstr ""
"对照同类描述包支持的硬件后端和控制器分组，完成本机型的 ros2_control 接口与控制器配置。在 `interfaces` "
"中导入模块化的控制接口，在 `ros2_control/robot.xacro` 中组织整个 `hardware system` 的导入。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:312
#: 883d41dc46594c77a0f1eec15bedb0f0
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Launch key is `robot:=<key>` where the package is `{key}_description` "
"([robot_common_launch](../../4-reference/descriptions/2-common.md)). "
"`demo.launch.py` default is `cr5`."
msgstr ""
"启动键是 `robot:=<key>`，对应包名 "
"`{key}_description`（[robot_common_launch](../../4-reference/descriptions/2-common.md)）。`demo.launch.py`"
" 默认是 `cr5`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:314
#: ba5c7b5c06b54a9c9b5feec9871ba984
msgid ""
"`hardware:=` values that exist in Acone xacro / common launch: "
"`mock_components` (default), `gz`, `isaac`, `real`. There is **no** "
"`hardware:=mock`. Mock sign-off on this page uses `mock_components`. "
"Plugins: [ros2_control in This "
"Stack](../../3-concepts/1-ros2_control_here.md). Use the plugin class "
"from that robot’s `xacro/ros2_control/*.xacro` or an existing vendor HI "
"README ([arx-ros2-control](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arx-"
"ros2-control) for ARX `hardware:=real`)."
msgstr ""
"Acone xacro / common launch 中存在的 `hardware:=` "
"取值：`mock_components`（默认）、`gz`、`isaac`、`real`。**没有** `hardware:=mock`。插件见 "
"[本技术栈中的 ros2_control](../../3-concepts/1-ros2_control_here.md)。使用该机器人 "
"`xacro/ros2_control/*.xacro` 中的插件类或已有厂商 HI README（ARX `hardware:=real` 见 "
"[arx-ros2-control](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arx-ros2-control)）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:317
#: d5c865e659fa4d05b3b4223a3af6c120
msgid "2.2 URDF for OCS2 motion control"
msgstr "2.2 针对 OCS2 运控用 URDF 的处理"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:319
#: 8c37c50b65e94a309b9cb69b3bba4c14
msgid ""
"The planning model is what OCS2 uses. It can differ from the runtime "
"model. The items below are how that planning URDF is handled."
msgstr "规划模型供 OCS2 使用，可以和运行模型不同。下面处理规划用 URDF。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:321
#: 11562351e81e4ec188bd6ae80c763a0f
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"OCS2 files the controller actually loads: "
"`{robot_pkg}/config/ocs2/<info>.info` ([ocs2_arm "
"README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/controller/ocs2_arm_controller/README.md))."
" Planning URDF comes from the same xacro via `robot_common_launch`, not a"
" static `urdf/*.urdf`."
msgstr ""
"控制器实际加载的 OCS2 文件：`{robot_pkg}/config/ocs2/<info>.info`（[ocs2_arm "
"README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/controller/ocs2_arm_controller/README.md)）。规划"
" URDF 由同一套 xacro 经 `robot_common_launch` 生成，不是静态 `urdf/*.urdf`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:324
#: c013531c793a43e8a736b9c3ab7f21b0
msgid ""
"Expand the runtime model and the planning model with the launch "
"parameters you actually use. Check the active joints, the joints locked "
"during planning, and the joints a separate controller owns. Confirm the "
"end-effector frames and the collision geometry that planning needs are "
"still there, and check the limits that planning and control actually use."
msgstr "按实际启动参数分别展开运行模型和规划模型，核对活动关节、规划中锁定的关节及独立控制器负责的关节。确认规划所需的末端参考系和碰撞几何仍存在，并核对规划和控制实际使用的限位。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:326
#: 419a159dc0f3461a98b2ab98f65e1439
msgid ""
"In the planning model, fix or disable joints that OCS2 does not plan, "
"such as the gripper and the dexterous hand, and keep the TCP and the "
"collision geometry that planning needs. The runtime model can keep the "
"active joints and the follower joints, with a separate controller owning "
"them. The switch that fixes those joints follows the configuration of "
"this robot."
msgstr ""
"在规划模型里固定或关闭夹爪、灵巧手等不由 OCS2 规划的关节，并保留规划所需的 TCP "
"和碰撞几何。运行模型可以保留主动和随动关节，由独立控制器负责。固定开关参数按本机型实际配置。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:328
#: b653c0c6cc274d1298c25052a7650bb9
msgid ""
"For joints that easily fall into an unwanted pose or a local optimum, the"
" range can be tightened in the planning URDF that OCS2 uses. Record the "
"joint, the old range, the new range, and the reason, and keep that record"
" apart from the real hardware limits. Leave the runtime URDF and the "
"mechanical limits unchanged."
msgstr ""
"对容易落入不期望构型或局部最优的部分关节，可以在 OCS2 使用的规划 URDF "
"里适当收紧范围。记录调整的关节、原来的范围、新的范围和原因，并与实际硬件限位区分开。运行 URDF 和机械限位保持不变。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:330
#: efb03213a4e740188260ad5aab847827
msgid ""
"Sign off in Mock with HOME and a few representative targets. The motion "
"stays inside the planning range, and the motions you need are still "
"covered. Then compare the planning model with the related entries in "
"`task.info` and confirm they agree."
msgstr ""
"用 HOME 和若干代表性目标在 Mock 中验收：规划范围无越界，所需动作仍能覆盖。再对照规划模型和 `task.info` "
"里的相关配置，确认前后一致。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:332
#: 7b976cb3a27e46a7b062626c2221946e
msgid ""
"When you fill in `task.info`, follow the joint order printed in the OCS2 "
"startup log, and check the initial state, the limits, and the other "
"entries one by one. The joint order declared in the URDF can differ from "
"the order after Pinocchio imports the model."
msgstr ""
"配置 `task.info` 时，按 OCS2 启动日志输出的关节顺序，逐项核对初始状态、限位等配置。注意：URDF 中的关节声明顺序可能与 "
"Pinocchio 导入后的顺序不同。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:334
#: fa0a98ef9128464aac68e12dea46fc9b
msgid "2.3 Mock sign-off"
msgstr "2.3 Mock 验收"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:336
#: 8b66a40907af46b8bbd702ed44a83cc1
msgid ""
"Controllers already in [arms_ros2_control](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control): `ocs2_arm_controller` `demo.launch.py` / "
"`split_body.launch.py` / `full_body.launch.py`, plus "
"`basic_joint_controller`. Example from the Acone README (after the "
"workspace overlay):"
msgstr ""
"[arms_ros2_control](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control) "
"里已有的控制器：`ocs2_arm_controller` 的 `demo.launch.py` / `split_body.launch.py`"
" / `full_body.launch.py`，以及 `basic_joint_controller`。Acone README 示例（工作区 "
"overlay 之后）："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:338
#: eede54d29f1c4b738f705aba796f781f
msgid "ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=arx_acone"
msgstr "ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py robot:=arx_acone"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:342
#: 852d224d9c0b4668828b049b3aba4ad0
msgid ""
"Leave `hardware` at the default `mock_components` for this sign-off. "
"`full_body.launch.py` needs `ocs2_wbc_controller` from the `ros-jazzy-"
"arms-ros2-control` deb."
msgstr ""
"这一步签收时，`hardware` 保持默认的 `mock_components`。`full_body.launch.py` 需要 `ros-"
"jazzy-arms-ros2-control` 这个 deb 里的 `ocs2_wbc_controller`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:344
#: b9eb187be69c4290a9f7c95155ebbdac
msgid ""
"Test the real states one by one: HOLD, HOME, MOVEJ, and OCS2. Record "
"which modes can drag a target or control joints, and keep a single "
"publish apart from a continuous publish. After you enter a target mode "
"you can interact with, use the RViz target marker to check the end-"
"effector target against the real gripper position."
msgstr ""
"按 HOLD、HOME、MOVEJ、OCS2 "
"的实际状态逐项测试。记录哪些模式支持拖目标或关节控制，区分单次发布和连续发布。进入可交互的目标模式后，用 RViz "
"目标框核对末端目标与夹爪实际位置。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:346
#: ef90f119d9fc46de91d5bab34d78d6e2
msgid "2.4 Sign-off for more than one control mode"
msgstr "2.4 多控制模式验收"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:348
#: 87c3139242754aefafa785e24f96b4ae
msgid ""
"When this robot is delivered with more than one control mode, sign each "
"mode off on its own."
msgstr "本机型交付多种控制模式时，分别验收。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:350
#: 0dcf2c659bec4d36a3520a9fe69b744f
msgid ""
"Start each control mode you deliver. Check the controllers that are "
"actually active, how the joints are divided, and the target frame. Arm, "
"head, and gripper controllers can divide the work differently from one "
"mode to another. Send a small command and check that the command and the "
"feedback match. When the mode has a coupled behavior such as automatic "
"gaze, check the coupled target and the real response together."
msgstr "分别启动交付的各控制模式，核对实际激活的控制器、关节分工和目标坐标系。手臂、头部和夹爪的控制器分工可能随模式不同。用小幅指令检查命令与反馈是否对应，支持自动注视等联动时同时检查联动目标和实际响应。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:352
#: 7ffd5e5b624642ff9b097ae6583b57a4
msgid "2.5 Planning collision"
msgstr "2.5 规划碰撞"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:354
#: ef759d5b382d447e94e3c92e4158caca
msgid ""
"This section checks the collision geometry used for planning, and the "
"OCS2 collision pairs, which are used for distance queries while planning."
" Physical contact inside Isaac Sim is checked in Chapter 3."
msgstr "本节检查规划用碰撞几何和 OCS2 碰撞对，用于规划中的距离计算。Isaac Sim 里的物理接触在第 3 章检查。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:356
#: e83e064c5ab24548a8ef2dd63ec779c4
msgid ""
"In RViz, show the visual geometry and the collision geometry at the same "
"time. Look in particular for a long uncovered stretch between the "
"shoulder and the elbow, on the elbow cover, at the wrist seam, and on the"
" column."
msgstr "在 RViz 同时对照显示几何与碰撞几何。重点检查肩肘之间的长壳、肘盖、腕部接缝和立柱有没有大段漏覆盖。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:358
#: c9100d1790bd4aecb2424411f2786820
msgid ""
"Check the geometry type, the length, the radius, the direction, and the "
"link the shape is attached to. A transverse cylinder on the elbow cover "
"and a longitudinal cylinder on the upper arm, for example, cover "
"different regions."
msgstr "检查几何类型、长度、半径、方向和挂载连杆。比如横向肘盖圆柱与纵向大臂圆柱分别覆盖不同区域。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:360
#: 66ca14a47e3d4edfb24a1034094b9b1a
msgid ""
"Check which link pairs OCS2 actually enables. A collision body that RViz "
"can draw takes part in that distance query only when its link is in a "
"configured pair. After a rename, check that each collision pair still "
"resolves, compare the configuration before and after, and confirm which "
"names moved and what was really added or removed. Check each affected "
"region again with a normal motion and with a motion that comes close to "
"interference, and watch the distance and the controller response."
msgstr ""
"检查 OCS2 实际启用了哪些连杆对。RViz "
"能画出的碰撞体，只有其连杆出现在配置对里才会参与对应距离计算。改名后检查各碰撞对能否解析，并对比前后配置，确认名称迁移和实际增删。受影响区域分别用正常动作和接近干涉的动作复验，观察距离和控制器响应。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:362
#: d701d3442cbb47199c968056daf19615
msgid "2.6 Solve behavior and steady-state jitter"
msgstr "2.6 求解与稳态抖动"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:364
#: bb97f91b68624d35be8fec788fd1169c
msgid ""
"Do this section when the solve misbehaves, the steady state jitters, or "
"the MPC needs a change. A first integration does not start by tuning "
"every parameter."
msgstr "出现求解异常、稳态抖动或需要调整 MPC 时再做本节。首次接入不必默认调完所有参数。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:366
#: bf53ee74ccec4303923a846ed957376d
msgid ""
"With the target held fixed, record the target pose, the current pose, the"
" joint feedback, and the MPC time when it is available, at the same time."
" A small move on the RViz error panel has to be read against the joint "
"data."
msgstr "固定目标后同步采集目标位姿、当前位姿、关节反馈与可用的 MPC 耗时。RViz 误差面板小幅变化需要与关节数据对照。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:368
#: 6c80166399ac4358894d965a856baedd
msgid ""
"Under Mock, check the log for the FSM switching back and forth, for a "
"collision trigger, for a solver error, or for a timing warning."
msgstr "在 Mock 下检查日志中的 FSM 反复切换、碰撞触发、求解报错或定时告警。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:370
#: c8314757f6a44d17aef47c20e7a725c8
msgid ""
"Change one variable at a time, with the same HOME, the same target, and "
"the same observation window. Record the time to arrive and the steady-"
"state end error. Use the largest single-step joint change, the peak-to-"
"peak value, and the net drift to tell high-frequency jitter apart from a "
"slow drift of the pose. After the single-step change gets smaller, the "
"joints can still drift slowly while the end target stays fixed."
msgstr ""
"用同一 "
"HOME、同一目标和同一观测窗口做单变量对照。记录到位时间和稳态末端误差，并用最大单步关节变化、峰峰值和净漂移区分高频微抖与缓慢构型漂移。单步变化变小以后，关节仍可能在固定末端目标下缓慢漂移。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:372
#: f854e51f2e464d3082080907d503561a
msgid ""
"Compare `inputCost.R.arm.scaling`, the per-joint velocity weights, the "
"running and terminal end-effector weights, the MPC rate, and how far "
"ahead the policy sample is taken. Confirm the value that actually takes "
"effect, and its unit."
msgstr ""
"对照 `inputCost.R.arm.scaling`、逐关节速度权重、末端运行与终端权重、MPC "
"频率和策略取样提前量。确认参数的实际生效值和单位。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:374
#: adde6eb8cd914d8ca3befcb110172619
msgid "2.7 Sign-off and handoff"
msgstr "2.7 验收与交接"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:376
#: 47bb78228c6d46cf82d571e1f866bfa9
msgid ""
"Check that the Mock control entry, the collision-pair count, the links, "
"and the commands in the README match the current code."
msgstr "核对 README 中的 Mock 控制入口、碰撞对数量、链接和命令与当前代码一致。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:380
#: 8cf75b852bfb45f4be8637e24015d33a
msgid "3. Import into Isaac Sim and close the loop"
msgstr "​3. 导入 Isaac Sim 并联调"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:382
#: 5799af81bb954857948b669f9783751b
msgid ""
"This chapter imports the robot into FaSim / Isaac Sim, organizes the USD "
"layers, checks physics and sensors, and closes the loop between control "
"commands and feedback."
msgstr "本章把机型导入 FaSim / Isaac Sim，组织 USD 层，检查物理和传感器，并完成控制命令与反馈闭环。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:384
#: 00f77f126dca43c3a55bc47479c74c5f
msgid ""
"Before simulation bring-up for this robot, run the Isaac startup and the "
"bring-up on a similar existing robot. Look at normal simulation and "
"control feedback, and use that as the reference."
msgstr "开始本机型的仿真联调前，先用同类现有机器人跑通 Isaac 的启动和联调，看过正常的仿真和控制反馈，作为参照。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:386
#: 42406cd211754c7dbd971a06a3b5a2d0
msgid "3.1 Directories, layers, and startup"
msgstr "3.1 目录、层与启动"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:388
#: ec008943684b4222804b7961b637645c
msgid ""
"In the FaSim `robots` submodule, find a robot with a similar structure "
"and purpose and record its directory path. The layout looks like this:"
msgstr "在 FaSim 的 `robots` 子模块里，找一个结构和用途接近的机器人作为参考，记录其目录路径。参考结构如下："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:390
#: 5d28a278c9e849e78d759fb76d772944
msgid ""
"robots/<category>/<vendor>/[series/]/<Robot>/\n"
"├── <Robot>.usda           # whole-robot asset entry; composes the robot "
"layers\n"
"├── payloads/              # parts, geometry, materials, physics, "
"sensors, and the ROS layers\n"
"├── env/                   # empty scene or demo scene that references "
"the robot, including the ground\n"
"├── Textures/              # textures or material assets this robot needs"
" to ship with the asset\n"
"└── README.md              # entry and usage, when similar robots follow "
"this convention"
msgstr ""
"robots/<category>/<vendor>/[series/]/<Robot>/\n"
"├── <Robot>.usda           # whole-robot asset entry; composes the robot "
"layers\n"
"├── payloads/              # parts, geometry, materials, physics, "
"sensors, and the ROS layers\n"
"├── env/                   # empty scene or demo scene that references "
"the robot, including the ground\n"
"├── Textures/              # textures or material assets this robot needs"
" to ship with the asset\n"
"└── README.md              # entry and usage, when similar robots follow "
"this convention"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:399
#: 104f535acf5e45e48aa6f4eaca72d321
msgid ""
"`robots` is a submodule of the FaSim workspace. The top-level path "
"follows that workspace. `[series/]` is optional. Category and vendor "
"names can differ from the description package. Follow a similar robot in "
"this submodule. `<category>`, `<vendor>`, and `[series/]` stand for the "
"category, the vendor, and the optional series level. An existing shared "
"USD is referenced from the whole-robot entry or from the matching "
"component layer. This robot defines the mount pose. Use the directories "
"this robot and this delivery need."
msgstr ""
"`robots` 是 FaSim 工作区中的子模块。顶层路径以该工作区惯例为准。`[series/]` "
"为可选层级。类别和厂家命名可能与描述包不同，按该子模块里的同类机型来。`<category>`、`<vendor>` 和 `[series/]` "
"分别是类别、厂家和可选的系列层级。已有的共享 USD 在整机入口或相应组件层引用，安装位姿由本机型定义。各目录按机型和交付范围取用。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:401
#: dae91cf243d8400697ab3b2b9d5d56e4
msgid ""
"Isaac import is the FaSim-Isaac skill **`isaac-urdf-usda-ocs2`** (not the"
" description-side `split-chassis-glb` skill):"
msgstr ""
"Isaac 导入用 FaSim-Isaac 的 **`isaac-urdf-usda-ocs2`**（不是描述包这边的 `split-"
"chassis-glb`）："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:403
#: 11eda3ba8acf40bb8f6bf96585046d82
msgid ""
"Skill file: [`.cursor/skills/USDA-OCS2-PhysX-"
"Mujoco/SKILL.md`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/FaSim-"
"Isaac/blob/main/.cursor/skills/USDA-OCS2-PhysX-Mujoco/SKILL.md)"
msgstr ""
"Skill 文件：[`.cursor/skills/USDA-OCS2-PhysX-"
"Mujoco/SKILL.md`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/FaSim-"
"Isaac/blob/main/.cursor/skills/USDA-OCS2-PhysX-Mujoco/SKILL.md)"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:404
#: 8f281acf5b1e4985b413bfca6e301833
msgid ""
"Other skills in that folder: `fasim-robot-mujoco-physics`, `fasim-"
"dexhand-asset`, `fasim-rg75-pad-convert`, `fasim-usd-bake-scale`"
msgstr ""
"该目录下其他 skill：`fasim-robot-mujoco-physics`、`fasim-dexhand-asset`、`fasim-"
"rg75-pad-convert`、`fasim-usd-bake-scale`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:406
#: 5afe1008bc584b61b9617ce78077e97e
msgid ""
"What that skill covers (overview; follow the skill for the full "
"procedure):"
msgstr "该 skill 覆盖的内容（概览；完整步骤以 skill 为准）："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:408
#: d40ab8cb7bd743688bf7cdb5582e1a0e
msgid "Split / expand URDF or xacro; record mount poses."
msgstr "拆分 / 展开 URDF 或 xacro；记录安装位姿。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:409
#: e47bac1cb3e9484a8e8edde1f265a168
msgid "Isaac 5: Import URDF → USD. Isaac 6: Asset Transformer → USDA."
msgstr "Isaac 5：Import URDF → USD。Isaac 6：Asset Transformer → USDA。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:410
#: eaa300ce666d460d841f4a4e1ecf4965
msgid "Robot Assembler (child → parent; one articulation root)."
msgstr "Robot Assembler（子 → 父；一个 articulation root）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:411
#: cfe3fbcb5dfb46698c989b771671d3a1
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Root `variantSets` + **local** adapter payloads "
"(`payloads/Physics/{none,physics,physx,mujoco}.usda`, …)."
msgstr ""
"根 `variantSets` + **本地** adapter "
"payload（`payloads/Physics/{none,physics,physx,mujoco}.usda` 等）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:412
#: 4f287fff628c425a95b7c4ac11d185e3
msgid ""
"PhysX vs Newton/MuJoCo layers kept separate. Connect ROS 2 with one path:"
" host `hardware:=isaac` (`TopicBasedSystem`) **or** a `ROS2ControlLaunch`"
" payload that sets in-process `isaac_sim`. Do not bridge the same joints "
"on both."
msgstr ""
"PhysX 与 Newton/MuJoCo 层分开保留。ROS 2 只接一条路径：宿主机 "
"`hardware:=isaac`（`TopicBasedSystem`），**或**由 `ROS2ControlLaunch` 载荷设置进程内 "
"`isaac_sim`。同一批关节不要两套一起桥。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:414
#: 020a49d7c4b342bf87d7fe9c96a090f1
msgid ""
"Asset layout: [robot_usds README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_usds/blob/main/README.md) (`robots/manipulators/…`, "
"`robots/mobile_manipulator/…`). FaSim-Isaac checkout: **`./init.sh`** "
"(submodules + optional Isaac ROS 2 workspace), then **`./run.sh`**. See "
"[Isaac Sim](../2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md)."
msgstr ""
"资产布局：[robot_usds README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_usds/blob/main/README.md)（`robots/manipulators/…`、`robots/mobile_manipulator"
"/…`）。FaSim-Isaac 检出后：**`./init.sh`**（子模块 + 可选 Isaac ROS 2 工作区），然后 "
"**`./run.sh`**。不要手写 Isaac `PATH` 或 `~/.bashrc` overlay。见 [Isaac "
"Sim](../2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:416
#: c3a439837f7c46fa8b4f5178a736becd
msgid ""
"Start from the entry points in the FaSim README. Keep the ordinary empty "
"scene, the grasp scene, and the other backends apart, and confirm a "
"second Isaac process was not started by accident."
msgstr "按 FaSim README 的入口启动。区分普通空场景、抓取场景和其他后端，确认没有意外启动第二个 Isaac 进程。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:418
#: 3dae0f2c89534c13ba771c139edb910a
msgid ""
"Confirm the FaSim assets land in this robot’s directory under the "
"`robots` submodule. Organize the whole-robot entry, geometry, parts, "
"physics, materials, sensors, and ROS as separate layers. Left and right "
"parts can each have their own assembly nodes in the same layer."
msgstr ""
"确认 FaSim 资产落在 `robots` 子模块对应机型目录。把整机入口、几何、部件、物理、材质、传感器和 ROS "
"分层组织，左右部件可在同一层里配置各自装配节点。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:420
#: 83341c2adbc04d29b15d4375fdb7a27b
msgid ""
"Check every local relative reference in the USD, the `defaultPrim` of "
"each layer, the robot root prim, the variants, the joint paths, and the "
"ActionGraph targets. Open the empty scene and the grasp scene separately."
msgstr ""
"核对 USD 每个本地相对引用、层的 `defaultPrim`、机器人根 Prim、变体、关节路径和 ActionGraph "
"目标。空场景与抓取场景分别打开。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:422
#: 0859259fc8cb4e118d902c8cd1ce71a3
msgid ""
"After a GLB is converted to USD, check materials, material subsets, "
"emission, instanced mirrors, and origins. Before an old visual mesh is "
"removed, check whether a collision asset, such as a gripper, still "
"references the old path."
msgstr "GLB 转 USD 后检查材质、材质子集、发光、实例镜像和原点。回收旧显示几何前先查是否仍有夹爪等碰撞资产引用原路径。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:424
#: d8db6298dd554b4291b0c6f00fd8eb49
msgid ""
"Keep the job of `geometries.usd` apart from the job of the material "
"layer. If visual geometry moves, confirm every part reference moves with "
"it, and that the physics and material bindings still resolve after the "
"layers are composed."
msgstr "区分 `geometries.usd` 与材质层的职责。若迁移显示几何，确认所有部件引用随之更新，物理和材质绑定在合成后仍能解析。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:426
#: a912e304709149d0ae66e92dd62b3b04
msgid "3.2 Physical contact"
msgstr "3.2 物理接触"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:428
#: 1e42a98a824c43cd9a065ae0e3e9099e
msgid ""
"This section checks settling on the ground, support, and contact in Isaac"
" Sim. That is simulation physics. The physics collision meshes used by "
"simulation are handled in the USD simulation assets."
msgstr "本节检查 Isaac Sim 中的落地、支撑和接触，属于仿真物理。仿真用的物理碰撞网格放在 USD 仿真资产中处理。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:430
#: a50f4c24202a492182a116cbab6b4e74
msgid ""
"Planning collision stays in the description package. Chapter 2 uses it "
"for OCS2 distance queries. Physical contact in Isaac uses collision "
"shapes or meshes configured on the USD asset."
msgstr "规划碰撞留在描述包里。第 2 章用它做 OCS2 的距离查询。Isaac 里的物理接触，用 USD 资产上配置的碰撞形状或网格。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:432
#: 2fbaf5b180af47dcba6d22c51e340fd7
msgid ""
"On import, go through the collision that arrived with the URDF. Remove "
"simplified collision bodies written for planning, or replace them with "
"the contact collision for the simulation. Those planning bodies do not "
"follow the real geometry. Left in the Isaac physics simulation, contact "
"is not accurate. In the USD, set the collision shapes or meshes for "
"physical contact from the real geometry. A convex decomposition, or "
"another simplified shape that still follows that geometry, can be the "
"contact collision. The high-resolution visual triangle mesh stays on the "
"visual. It is not the dynamic collision mesh."
msgstr "导入时把随 URDF 进来的碰撞过一遍。规划用的简化碰撞体去掉，或换成仿真用的接触碰撞。这些规划碰撞体不贴实际几何，留在 Isaac 物理仿真里，接触就不准。在 USD 里按实际几何配置用于物理接触的碰撞形状或网格。凸分解，或者另一种仍然贴着该几何的简化形状，可以作为接触碰撞。高精视觉三角网格留在显示上，不拿来做动态碰撞。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:434
#: f2f4099eda9a4d19b9f74f5d86442234
msgid ""
"In Isaac, show the collision, check that the bounds sit on the real "
"geometry, and check that contact happens where the parts actually meet."
msgstr "在 Isaac 里打开碰撞显示，核对边界是否贴着实际几何，并核对接触是否发生在零件真正碰上的位置。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:436
#: 4204df1fde7f42d8bbe077d1d603c683
msgid ""
"**Incorrect example.** The figure below is a wrong result, not a "
"recommended configuration. Simplified collision bodies from planning were"
" carried into the Isaac physics simulation. The collision bounds do not "
"match the real geometry, so contact is not accurate."
msgstr "**错误示例。** 下图是错误结果，不是推荐配置。规划用的简化碰撞体被带进了 Isaac 物理仿真。碰撞边界与实际几何不符，接触因此不准。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:438
#: f3cacfb687df49aea7b215b180406bf5
msgid ""
"![Incorrect example: planning collision bodies carried into the Isaac "
"physics simulation](images/isaac-planning-collision-incorrect.png)"
msgstr "![错误示例：规划简化碰撞体被带入 Isaac 物理仿真](images/isaac-planning-collision-incorrect.png)"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:438
#: 0e94679cb8734d8d8dd85d738a671714
msgid ""
"Incorrect example: planning collision bodies carried into the Isaac "
"physics simulation"
msgstr "错误示例：规划简化碰撞体被带入 Isaac 物理仿真"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:440
#: 1d3e9a34dcfc4287b6662630e59d5dfb
msgid ""
"This screenshot is an incorrect example. Simplified collision from the "
"planning model is active in the Isaac physics view. The collision bounds "
"do not match the robot geometry, and contact is not accurate. This is not"
" a configuration to copy."
msgstr "这张截图是错误示例。规划模型里的简化碰撞出现在 Isaac 的物理视图里。碰撞边界与机器人几何不符，接触不准。这不是可以照抄的配置。"

msgid "**Correct example.** The figure below is the physical collision configured from the real part geometry, placed next to the incorrect example. In Isaac, check that the collision follows the part outline and where contact sits."
msgstr "**正确示例。** 下图是按实际零件几何配置的物理碰撞体，紧挨着上面的错误示例。在 Isaac 里核对碰撞是否贴着零件轮廓，以及接触落在哪里。"

msgid "![Correct example: physical collision configured from the real part geometry](images/isaac-physical-collision-correct.png)"
msgstr "![正确示例：按实际零件几何配置的物理碰撞体](images/isaac-physical-collision-correct.png)"

msgid "Correct example: physical collision configured from the real part geometry"
msgstr "正确示例：按实际零件几何配置的物理碰撞体"

msgid "This screenshot is a correct example. The collision is configured from the real part geometry for physical contact. Check the outline fit and the contact position. The previous figure is still the incorrect example: simplified collision bodies from planning used in the physics simulation."
msgstr "这张截图是正确示例。碰撞按实际零件几何配置，用于物理接触。核对轮廓贴合和接触位置。上一张仍是错误示例：规划用的简化碰撞体被用进了物理仿真。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:442
#: db50e4be49d34d53a989f6c1af8dfaa6
msgid ""
"On import, remove or replace simplified collision bodies written for "
"planning. In the USD, configure collision shapes or meshes for physical "
"contact from the real geometry. In Isaac, check the fit of the bounds and"
" the contact."
msgstr "导入时去掉或替换规划用的简化碰撞体。在 USD 里按实际几何配置用于物理接触的碰撞形状或网格。在 Isaac 里核对边界是否贴合，以及接触是否正确。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:444
#: f6df81215f7140649389e3059499367d
msgid ""
"Put a ground and a physics scene in the empty scene. After the simulation"
" starts, check the ground height, how the robot is fixed, whether the "
"support is stable, and whether collision penetrates, and check the limits"
" the simulation actually uses."
msgstr "空场景放置地面和物理场景。开始仿真后检查落地高度、固定方式、支撑稳定性和碰撞穿透，并核对仿真实际使用的限位。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:446
#: f9105b587d914e24b39214c9eb79a5f0
msgid ""
"When the base is unstable, compare the wheel collision shape, the ground "
"collision shape, the initial position, and the contact settings "
"separately. On a retest, keep the initial pose and the contact parameters"
" fixed, and change only the wheels or only the ground. One combination "
"falling over only says that combination has a problem. Changing one item "
"at a time is what shows which change made the support more stable."
msgstr "底座不稳时分别对照轮碰撞形状、地面碰撞形状、初始位置及接触设置。复测时固定初始位姿与接触参数，分别只改轮或只改地面。某一组合失稳，只能说明这套搭配有问题，单项对照才能判断哪项改动改善了稳定性。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:448
#: 12c9eeabf8f84c84a65cbd6e534756e0
msgid "3.3 Command and feedback loop"
msgstr "3.3 控制命令与反馈闭环"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:450
#: ae3bae59b889436cb657ee9e505067cd
msgid ""
"After you press Play, check that the ROS bridge has started, that a trial"
" command drives the robot in Isaac, and that RViz receives joint states "
"from the simulation. Check the simulation clock. Motion in RViz on its "
"own only says the current control chain responds. Check which hardware "
"backend is in use as well."
msgstr ""
"点 Play 后检查 ROS Bridge 已启动，确认试发指令能驱动 Isaac 机器人，且 RViz "
"接收到来自仿真的关节状态。核对仿真时钟。RViz 自己能动只说明当前控制链有响应，需另核对所用硬件后端。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:452
#: 9ccf1f009f7741fa9c0c5a9ba0108e77
msgid ""
"Record the ROS description package and the USD version that were signed "
"off together. After a joint name, a frame, or a command interface "
"changes, compare the Xacro, the controller configuration, the bridge "
"mapping, and the USD layer by layer, and confirm the interfaces and the "
"mapping match on both sides. After both sides are on the latest commit, "
"still check the mapping and the joint names."
msgstr ""
"记录配对验收的 ROS 描述包和 USD 版本。关节名、参考系或指令接口变动后，逐层对照 Xacro、控制器配置、桥接映射和 "
"USD，确认两边的接口及映射一致。两边都更新到最新提交后，仍要核对映射和关节名。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:454
#: 47416164a61941ac808892c25462f740
msgid ""
"Compare gripper feedback in RViz and in Isaac at open, closed, and "
"partial opening. When the gripper needs to open and close gradually, "
"check the interpolation, the speed limit, and how the control interface "
"runs that motion. When `adaptive_gripper_controller` is used, check that "
"the controller stops after the force goes over the limit."
msgstr ""
"对比 RViz 和 Isaac 中夹爪开启、闭合和部分开度的反馈。需要渐进开合时，检查插值、速度限制及控制接口的执行方式。使用 "
"`adaptive_gripper_controller` 时，检查力超过上限后控制器会停机。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md
msgid "**Incorrect example.** The clip below is a gripper whose `mimic` is not configured correctly. The fingers and the linkages pass through each other, and the two sides do not move together. This is not the force-limit stop of `adaptive_gripper_controller`."
msgstr "**错误示例。** 下面这段是夹爪的 `mimic` 没有配置好。手指和多连杆互相穿插，左右两侧运动不同步。这不是 `adaptive_gripper_controller` 受力达到上限后停止。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md
msgid ""
"<video controls preload=\"metadata\" width=\"100%\" aria-labelledby=\"gripper-mimic-incorrect\">\n"
"  <source src=\"../../_static/videos/gripper-mimic-misconfigured.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n"
"</video>"
msgstr ""
"<video controls preload=\"metadata\" width=\"100%\" aria-labelledby=\"gripper-mimic-incorrect\">\n"
"  <source src=\"../../_static/videos/gripper-mimic-misconfigured.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n"
"</video>"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md
msgid "Check the driving joint, the follower joints, the motion direction, and the multiplier and offset. The imported gripper has to match that relationship."
msgstr "检查主动关节、从动关节、运动方向，以及倍率和偏置。导入后的夹爪要和这组关系一致。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md
msgid "**Incorrect example.** This clip is a separate case. The gripper `mimic` is already configured, and the two fingers close inward together. At the closed position the model and the collision wireframe overlap and pass through each other, and the gripper stays in that interference. This is not the force-limit stop of `adaptive_gripper_controller`."
msgstr "**错误示例。** 这段是另一则错误示例。夹爪的 `mimic` 已经配置，两指向内一起闭合。闭合处模型和碰撞线框重叠并互相穿插，夹爪停在这个干涉状态。这不是 `adaptive_gripper_controller` 受力达到上限后停止。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md
msgid ""
"<video controls preload=\"metadata\" width=\"100%\" aria-labelledby=\"gripper-self-collision-incorrect\">\n"
"  <source src=\"../../_static/videos/gripper-self-collision-misconfigured.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n"
"</video>"
msgstr ""
"<video controls preload=\"metadata\" width=\"100%\" aria-labelledby=\"gripper-self-collision-incorrect\">\n"
"  <source src=\"../../_static/videos/gripper-self-collision-misconfigured.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n"
"</video>"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md
msgid "Check the physics collision bodies inside the gripper, and the collision filter and self-collision setup for contact among those bodies. Through the full open and close, look for internal contact that should not be there. The two sides moving together still leaves the `mimic` direction, multiplier, and offset to be checked on their own."
msgstr "检查夹爪内部的物理碰撞体，以及这些碰撞体之间的碰撞过滤和自碰撞配置。在完整开合行程里查看不该出现的内部接触。两侧一起运动时，`mimic` 的方向、倍率和偏置仍要单独核对。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:456
#: fefb06c23c614371bd2584a4b2de1d1f
msgid "3.4 Sensors"
msgstr "3.4 传感器"

msgid "When `isaac` is true, the description omits the sensor `visual` and keeps the link frame. The fragment is in [1.6](#16-xacro-assembly). In Isaac, the camera and other sensor assets are modular USD pieces mounted on that frame."
msgstr "`isaac` 为真时，描述包不写传感器的 `visual`，`link` 坐标系保留。片段在 [1.6](#16-xacro-assembly)。相机和其他传感器在 Isaac 里作为模块化 USD 资产，装到这个坐标系上。"

msgid "The figure is a sketch of the mount after import. Check the position, the orientation, and the matching `frame`."
msgstr "下图是导入后的安装位置示意。核对位置、朝向，以及对应的 `frame`。"

msgid "![Camera and other sensor assets placed in Isaac after import](images/isaac-camera-asset-import.png)"
msgstr "![导入后装在 Isaac 里的相机等传感器资产](images/isaac-camera-asset-import.png)"

msgid "Camera and other sensor assets placed in Isaac after import"
msgstr "导入后装在 Isaac 里的相机等传感器资产"

msgid "This screenshot shows the asset in place after import. Check that the position and the orientation match the `frame` kept in the description."
msgstr "这张截图是资产导入后的安装位置。核对位置和朝向是否对上描述包保留的 `frame`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:458
#: 3c6be637e794465f957efbfa6fdcd917
msgid ""
"Confirm the sensor model and the shared asset. When a visual asset is "
"standing in for another, record that substitution, and check the "
"geometry, the optical frame, and the simulated output separately."
msgstr "核实传感器型号与共享资产。外观资产代用时记录替代关系，并分别验证几何、光学坐标和模拟输出。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:460
#: 6cbdbe6ad6eb4b4babbbc993898575ea
msgid ""
"On its own, look at the lens direction of the sensor mesh after it is "
"brought in from the shared asset. Then look at the real pose with the "
"whole-robot assembly script. Check whether the head shell or the torso "
"blocks the lens."
msgstr "独立查看从共享资源接入后传感器网格的镜头朝向，再用整机装配脚本查看实际位姿。检查镜头是否被头壳或躯干遮挡。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:462
#: bcbf58ed493d4342a933ef7b72922f37
msgid ""
"Keep the shell mount transform, the optical frame, and the simulation "
"Camera prim apart. When the shell is translated to line the assembly up, "
"check whether the optical pose should stay where it is. For a camera on "
"the underside, also check the view direction and the demo parameters."
msgstr "区分外壳安装变换、光学坐标和仿真 `Camera Prim`。平移外壳做装配对齐时，核实光学位姿是否需要保持。底部相机另核对取景方向及演示参数。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:464
#: b99fc399712b4297a9447f03e79230b2
msgid ""
"Check the parent, the origin, and the axes of the camera optical frame in"
" the whole-robot TF, and compare them with the real pose of the Camera "
"prim in Isaac. The ROS optical frame points +Z forward, +X to the right "
"of the image, and +Y down the image. The USD camera’s local frame points "
"−Z forward and +Y up. Convert with the convention that belongs to each "
"one."
msgstr ""
"核对相机光学坐标系在整机 TF 中的父节点、原点和轴向，并与 Isaac 中 `Camera Prim` 的实际位姿对照。ROS 光学系为 +Z "
"朝前、+X 朝画面右、+Y 朝画面下。USD Camera 局部 −Z 朝前、+Y 朝上。按各自约定换算。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:466
#: 983b227b297e4dfd9138568acaef713d
msgid ""
"After the conversion, switch to each camera and look at the real image. A"
" marker can be placed along the expected view direction, to check the "
"direction, which way is up in the image, and the field of view. When the "
"camera is mounted on a moving link, jog that joint and confirm the camera"
" follows. If a ROS image is published, also check that the message "
"`header.frame_id` resolves to the matching optical frame."
msgstr ""
"换算后，切换到每台相机查看实际画面。可在预期取景方向放置标记，核对方向、画面上下和视场。相机装在运动连杆上时，试动关节确认相机随动。若发布 ROS"
" 图像，再核对消息的 `header.frame_id` 能解析到对应光学系。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:468
#: 2b5315e250de4b03a1554582c5ca5349
msgid "3.5 Sign-off and handoff"
msgstr "3.5 验收与交接"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:470
#: b65ce3a45e874bc394b0816baab0472a
msgid ""
"Add the Isaac bring-up entry and the scene names to the README, and check"
" that the links and the commands match the current code. Use a generic "
"example workspace, paths relative to the repository, and the shortest "
"commands."
msgstr "README 补全 Isaac 联动入口和场景名称，并核对其中的链接、命令与当前代码一致。用通用示例工作空间、仓库相对路径和最简命令。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:474
#: f4670819bac04f14ba92ea7b67e5dd79
msgid "3.6 Skills you can consult"
msgstr "3.6 可参考的 skill"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/10-add_a_robot.md:476
#: 546fb10a6fbc4880b98af6a3ca1ba096
msgid ""
"These skills are there to consult and to help. Splitting meshes and "
"assigning colors has to be done by hand in Blender. The other steps can "
"use these skills, and you still check them on this page. The notes are "
"under `.cursor/skills/` in the company description repository. Open "
"`SKILL.md` in the matching directory."
msgstr ""
